There is a knock on the door.
It is Nina.
I open the door and smile proudly.
"Look, my first smørrebrød!" I say.
"Come and eat with me."
Nina comes into my kitchen.
I make a new slice for her.
Nina takes a bite and nods.
"You are becoming completely Danish, Maya!" she says.
We sit in the warm kitchen and eat together.
After the meal, Nina goes home.
I look around the kitchen.
I did it all by myself.
My first big shopping trip is done.
I am very happy.
